_name": "ScreenShot-03.png", "id": "553032207104915", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974740_553032210438248_9007250483209227513_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zLJfpMp8okwQ7kNvwFcal3d&_nc_oc=AdqPDnyVdmBC8tQhAHP3q6XSSTwTZf_wxUzIT7kxBkj-sVFjrlTUH6bJ7-Rq-D2hau4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4HFz4m0bnqb3AHUtskalPGccW2sU8PmYnGMisrqtxxrw&oe=6A1DA11E"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot-05.png", "id": "1063774034975181", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035371_1063774038308514_1405689482698066949_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7FhTZPvvQJAQ7kNvwGFdrQU&_nc_oc=AdrxteZqRa0eLveSyGtlGlY-TbmuaqNO7umY7dRL9q05xJDvaTJb5QXHdukuljBmo-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5E43QSKyIbdeRkiT45P8_ikh_VmTPI1jK-x80kpVRBDw&oe=6A1D7B50"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ScreenShot-01.png", "id": "8514674868623335", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KDBclwbBoDoQ7kNvwEzraUG&_nc_oc=AdqE5hTnpSKmgJLECFGj5nZd-L3iaHhmGHUNd2ZqbzSGzXHHsJq9mmrxLFdX7Pw99oc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4mqgygDN1VggS4_YSHWRvVPsZIt0WLZPfPqRocwWSLTQ&oe=6A1D8862"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=siOdcsoEkiQQ7kNvwFIVJNW&_nc_oc=AdpuRh82fhfzyv0OrFI4fEl44gE39rOKHA9rQqMCS1QkvwRa3nJj-jCh9HNJmCsDxYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af72sakm-8kuRZq9u2lVJLSWCxmBk4J_PB2GR-gvUbxfiA&oe=6A1D95F3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7znrMQ1MeGcQ7kNvwEG3xgp&_nc_oc=AdosogxwepbqoRQqR3Dc_E2l8wgbf-mv_R6dIQSUTDVSFXxH5SRTy3zwEnkpkJlkU1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6UlFAGpfk93wvsa3dzNb4A025a5wOICcfJTHTWayt_lQ&oe=6A1D8A6B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636